 技能）\n目标：让“自主智能式工作”感觉像一个产品，而不是一个终端。","tags":["opencode","人工智能","大语言模型","智能体","自主智能"]}},"publisherUrl":"https://openwork.software/","releaseDate":"2026-02-16","releaseDateSource":"manifest","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/different-ai/openwork/releases/tag/v0.11.79","schemaVersion":1,"source":"winget","upstream":{"commit":"97d6aa2689f0a05f7847653a62b8624720d15b5d","manifestVersion":"1.12.0","manifests":[{"path":"manifests/d/DifferentAI/OpenWork/0.11.79/DifferentAI.OpenWork.yaml","sha256":"9b044716ea182b4dfb4841d1f835ef60e8d5468ce1445707ad60d77f04607aa9"},{"path":"manifests/d/DifferentAI/OpenWork/0.11.79/DifferentAI.OpenWork.installer.yaml","sha256":"0164cc126522a4cfa338ae002c7ce300069e4cba863af80a92777290637a5366"},{"path":"manifests/d/DifferentAI/OpenWork/0.11.79/DifferentAI.OpenWork.locale.en-US.yaml","sha256":"75f31eda2f1b349786e9d364209d7f4f8d22a68837bcca1a9ee81b062b309959"},{"path":"manifests/d/DifferentAI/OpenWork/0.11.79/DifferentAI.OpenWork.locale.zh-CN.yaml","sha256":"488aaec773548c532d5fe71e9285a84c476f2c55196f9517310ce80c44c362b0"}],"repository":"microsoft/winget-pkgs"},"version":"0.11.79"}